  "content": "<p><strong>这是 Complementary 光影的俄语汉化版</strong></p><p><br><strong>- 加入&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/ck5htDSQPv\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Discord</a> 社区。<br>- 如果你想支持 Complementary 的发展，可以在&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/emingt\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 上支持。<br><br>如果你想支持我，可以给我点东西 :3<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsteamcommunity.com%252ftradeoffer%252fnew%252f%253fpartner%253d1238856841%2526token%253d5W3IjmNo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://steamcommunity.com/tradeoffer/new/?partner=1238856841&amp;amp;token=5W3IjmNo</a><br><br>安装方法：<br></strong></p><p>- 安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Reimagined 光影</a></p><p>- 打开光影压缩包，并按照以下路径进入：shaders/lang</p><p>- 将 ru_RU.lang 翻译文件放置在与 en_US.lang 文件相同的文件夹中。</p><p>- 享受汉化吧<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ed709b3c-42ea-4b7d-9100-baf3077eecc8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"840\" height=\"633\"></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>",
